{
  "doc": [
    "The exchanges of RFC 0001's mcpworkspace wire, in order, each a JSON-RPC request sent with the next id after an MCP initialization, and its result or error.",
    "The served workspace: inside.txt (ok), sub/a.txt (a), alias.txt -> inside.txt, linkout -> ../outside/secret.txt; a file k/<kind>, and a start of kind:<kind>, refused with that kind, its served text naming /srv/hidden/<kind>.",
    "A resource's text is JSON, shown with its keys sorted; ${root} stands for the served root, and * for what differs between runs.",
    "mcpworkspace/corpus_test.go replays it against the reference server, and maps its refusals back through the reference client."
  ],
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "name": "what the server keeps",
      "method": "agentworkspace/process.info",
      "params": {},
      "result": {
        "bounds": {
          "maxProcesses": 32,
          "maxReadBytes": 65536,
          "maxWriteBytes": 1048576
        },
        "reach": "*"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a workspace that offers no servers does not answer the server methods",
      "method": "agentworkspace/servers.list",
      "params": {},
      "error": {
        "code": -32601,
        "message": "method not found: \"agentworkspace/servers.list\""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "stat a file",
      "method": "resources/read",
      "params": {
        "uri": "agentworkspace:///stat?path=inside.txt"
      },
      "result": {
        "cacheScope": "private",
        "contents": [
          {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"info\":{\"modTime\":\"*\",\"mode\":420,\"name\":\"inside.txt\",\"size\":2}}",
            "uri": "agentworkspace:///stat?path=inside.txt"
          }
        ],
        "ttlMs": 0
      }
    },
